{"id":"vod_bf_43912","vodId":"43912","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"月刊少女野崎君","name_cn":"月刊少女野崎君","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/44d33524c1b4ea0f7a7afe37124e8199.jpg"},"summary":"故事从高中女生佐仓千代（小泽亚李 配音）的一场告白开始，她的暗恋对象是与自己同年级的男生——身高一米九、男子气概十足的野崎君（中村悠一 配音），而告白的结果居然是得到了他的亲笔签名。正当千代为自己的告白台词“我是你的粉丝”引起了误会而感到苦恼时，野崎君居然直接邀请千代回家。她又紧张又期待，谁知道等待着她的是一堆漫画原稿，她糊里糊涂地当起了漫画助手。千代这才知道，自己的心上人野崎君原来是知名少女漫画家。　　虽然作品以描绘细腻的少女心思著称，野崎君本人却意外地神经大条，而且完全没有恋爱经历，他的漫画角色原型来自身边的朋友，而这些“原型们”，尽是些极具反差萌的家伙……　　本动画改编自日本漫画家椿泉所创作的四格漫画作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:11:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/yuekanshaonvyeqijun/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:37.814Z"}